Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:49.01,0:01:49.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:03:19.97,0:03:20.01,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:13:02.01,0:13:02.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:22.99,0:22:23.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Comment: 50,0:23:52.99,0:23:53.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.21,0:00:25.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No way. Tomorrow's the start\Nof the new semester?!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:28.97,0:00:31.97,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Fuu, did you finish your summer homework?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.97,0:00:34.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Just barely.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.06,0:00:37.06,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Then you should do well\Non tomorrow's test.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What?! A test?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.98,0:00:42.56,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Iroha-chan told me there's one\Nright after break.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.19,0:00:45.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I totally forgot...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.07,0:00:52.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's Toko-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.37,0:00:55.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Umm... "This is a bit sudden, but..."
Dialogue: 50,0:00:56.24,0:00:58.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you free tomorrow?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:58.20,0:01:01.54,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's a gig for you on ARS TV!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:01.54,0:01:05.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"They really want you on their show, Lilly."
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.96,0:01:08.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Tomorrow? I can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.55,0:01:13.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, figures. I'll turn it down.\NSorry for the short notice!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.01,0:01:16.39,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:16.39,0:01:19.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I was asked to appear on a TV show tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:19.06,0:01:21.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.27,0:01:22.85,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,You have that test tomorrow too.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:24.02,0:01:25.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.48,0:01:29.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm busy enough with homework and idol stuff,\Nand now I have to take a test?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.07,Default,fuu,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:35.66,0:01:37.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.54,0:01:40.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Make this a world with no tests!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.29,0:01:46.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That'll do.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.09,0:01:49.01,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I don't know about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.81,0:03:26.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mom.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.52,0:03:29.98,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Goodbye! Take care!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.82,0:03:32.73,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Fuu, you have to go too.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.95,0:03:42.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Please! Tell me my spell worked!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.50,0:03:51.09,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,Nonoyama-san, you're late.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.76,0:03:59.34,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,Let's get straight into it.\NThe new semester starts today!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.34,0:04:03.26,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,I'm very pleased to see\Nyour excited faces again!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.64,0:04:04.56,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.68,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, no! Not the test!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.86,0:04:14.98,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,I have an announcement!\NOur school will no longer be doing tests!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.69,0:04:16.61,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.07,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,Or classes!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.70,0:04:21.78,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,You can all pass the time\Nhowever you please.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.78,0:04:22.74,Default,Fuu's Teacher,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.95,0:04:31.04,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No way. I didn't just get rid of tests,\NI got rid of classes entirely!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.67,0:04:33.00,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Woohoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.68,0:04:41.64,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,What do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.64,0:04:43.43,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Let's go to Medakaya!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.43,0:04:44.81,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.43,0:04:44.81,Alt,Classmate,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.81,0:04:45.43,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.43,0:04:48.64,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But Medakaya is outside the school!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.64,0:04:51.81,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Hey! You should come with us, Fuu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.81,0:04:52.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.61,0:04:57.32,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, why not. I'm in!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.91,0:05:07.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.50,0:05:14.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The teacher never came in.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.51,0:05:21.72,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Um, good morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.22,0:05:23.85,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Rui-chan! Morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.22,0:05:28.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Isn't today, um, kind of weird?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.85,0:05:31.56,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Not really. Right?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.60,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,Yeah. This is normal.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.44,0:05:37.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But why are there no classes?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.86,0:05:40.11,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,Nonoyama-san, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.11,0:05:42.15,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Are you feeling sick?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.24,0:05:45.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.74,0:05:51.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}There really are no classes.\NEveryone's goofing off.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.21,0:05:55.08,Default,Classmate,0,0,0,,Let's go to the park after this.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.54,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,I like the sound of that!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.54,Alt,Hayato,0,0,0,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.38,0:06:00.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}We really left school...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.88,0:05:59.51,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's nice out today.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.51,0:06:00.26,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.26,0:06:01.38,Default,Classmate,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's kind of hot.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.76,0:06:03.80,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,That cloud looks like a bird!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.80,0:06:05.39,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Huh? Which one?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.43,Default,Classmate,0,0,0,,I think it looks like a banana.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.43,0:06:08.56,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,A banana?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.56,0:06:09.47,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,What about that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.39,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a crab!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.39,0:06:13.52,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,What are you gonna buy at Medakaya?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.48,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,A kinakobo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.48,0:06:15.98,Default,Classmate,0,0,0,,I want some juice!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.11,0:06:20.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, my spell worked perfectly!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.65,0:06:22.19,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,That's surprising.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.19,0:06:23.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.66,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,Fuu!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.66,0:06:27.07,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Fuu-chan, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.07,0:06:28.12,Default,Hayato,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.66,0:06:30.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.92,0:06:35.17,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I came out here...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.09,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,during class time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.22,0:06:54.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Everything about this really is weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.77,0:07:00.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Maybe this is another prank by someone\Nfrom the magical land.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.07,0:07:03.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do you think, Azuki?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.95,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.49,0:07:07.82,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Why would someone do this?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.99,0:07:13.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,School is a place to study!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.71,0:07:24.30,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Kadoya, is this even good for us?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.72,0:07:27.59,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Of course it is. Let's go have some fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.22,0:07:29.60,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.60,0:07:36.39,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I want to get some new shoes.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.39,0:07:38.81,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Me too, but I'm broke.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.81,0:07:40.61,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.03,0:07:43.78,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Fuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.78,0:07:45.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, Sho-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.24,0:07:51.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, Sho-chan! Where are you going? Wanna play?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.62,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm busy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.33,0:07:56.62,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Are you now?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.75,0:07:59.29,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Another time, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.92,0:08:00.75,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.75,0:08:02.09,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.09,0:08:03.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.67,0:08:06.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're {\i1}always{\i0} busy.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.05,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.89,0:08:13.47,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,The coast is clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.47,0:08:14.18,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.27,0:08:19.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I don't know who's behind this prank,\Nbut I have to undo it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.31,0:08:20.44,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.94,0:08:21.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.57,0:08:31.03,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.41,0:08:35.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Turn the world back to how it should be!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.37,0:08:37.87,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,You've got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.34,0:08:47.38,Default,Iroha,0,0,0,,This looks good too!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.97,Default,Classmate,0,0,0,,I can't decide!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.97,0:08:50.38,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,There it is! Fortune gummies!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.51,0:08:56.97,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This one, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.97,0:08:58.27,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Enjoy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.27,0:08:59.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's see here...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's my fortune for today?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.53,0:09:08.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.11,0:09:11.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.57,0:09:14.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"Find the area of this shape"?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This isn't my fortune!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.04,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.12,0:09:20.79,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,It's a test.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.42,0:09:23.67,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Answer the problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.13,0:09:27.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You can't just make me...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.88,0:09:29.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Right, guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.22,0:09:33.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.64,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Now, on with it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.31,0:09:40.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.23,0:09:41.64,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.64,0:09:43.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.23,0:09:44.81,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop! Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.57,0:09:52.86,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Where did that girl go?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.41,0:09:56.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,She's still after me...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.58,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, what do I do?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.29,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What indeed.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.29,0:10:01.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.96,0:10:03.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.26,0:10:14.22,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.76,0:10:18.51,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.61,0:10:33.95,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.24,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.24,0:10:38.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.53,0:10:43.37,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Have you seen a little girl about\Nten years old pass through here?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.21,0:10:45.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I-I haven't!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.00,0:10:49.71,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,Maybe she went that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Somehow I fooled her.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.30,0:10:57.14,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,That was scary.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.14,0:11:00.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're telling me.\NA test at a sweets shop?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.39,0:11:02.14,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Very strange.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.14,0:11:05.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Maybe my magic wore off?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.19,0:11:07.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Alright, one more time!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.15,0:11:10.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, stay on lookout!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.02,0:11:11.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.44,0:11:14.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Get rid of tests for real this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.45,0:11:20.58,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,Eyes up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.37,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,Everyone quiet down.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.96,0:11:27.21,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's been quite the crazy day, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.21,0:11:29.42,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's start class.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.54,0:11:29.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Phew, everyone's back to normal.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.96,0:11:33.30,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,Today, we'll be taking a proficiency test.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.51,0:11:38.76,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,What's the matter?\NWhy are you all sitting in silence?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.76,0:11:40.60,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.60,0:11:41.93,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,That's a good question.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.93,0:11:43.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.23,Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,Why {\i1}are{\i0} we sitting down?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.69,Default,Student 2,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.69,0:11:47.65,Default,Student 1,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.65,0:11:48.60,Default,Student 2,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.90,0:11:52.98,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,I'll be going home,\Nso do whatever you wish to.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.78,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute! What about the test?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.53,0:11:59.53,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,Test? What are you talking about, Nonoyama?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.41,0:12:02.49,Default,Rui's Teacher,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.49,0:12:04.29,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,Let's go home too.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.04,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.05,0:12:16.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's going on...?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.81,0:12:23.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.81,0:12:27.60,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,It looks like someone\Noverpowered your spell.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.56,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Rui!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.98,0:12:32.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Right! I won't let them win!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.32,0:12:38.53,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly turned down that gig after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.53,0:12:40.07,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,The TV appearance?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.07,0:12:42.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah. I guess she's busy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.32,0:12:45.66,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I got the offer the day before yesterday,\Nand they're recording today.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.66,0:12:49.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I figured I'd ask in case,\Nbut I knew it was a long shot.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.21,0:12:54.00,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What do you think she's up to usually?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.01,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, time for class.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.01,0:13:00.76,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.47,0:13:09.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Someone has to be behind this.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.77,0:13:11.02,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Keep at it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.02,0:13:13.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.44,0:13:17.74,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please stop bothering me with this magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.70,0:13:22.91,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Are you not going back to your friends?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.91,0:13:26.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What if my spell stops working again?\NI'm too scared to go back...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.49,0:13:27.70,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.71,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, we finally found you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.67,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,We're from ARS TV!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.67,0:13:38.92,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,We came looking for you because\Nwe just {\i1}had{\i0} to have you on our show!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.30,0:13:42.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean the offer from yesterday?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.51,0:13:45.26,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I already told you, I can't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.26,0:13:46.89,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,You have to!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.89,0:13:48.97,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's start filming!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.97,0:13:50.98,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Ready? Three, two...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.98,0:13:53.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I already said no! Ugh!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.85,0:13:56.77,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up! Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.45,0:14:03.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.62,0:14:08.83,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Isn't that...?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.62,0:14:12.62,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Shota, what do you wanna sing at karaoke?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.04,0:14:15.00,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Shota? Hello?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.54,0:14:17.38,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.34,0:14:20.88,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Yo, Shota!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.34,0:14:23.30,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.68,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Help us perform a camera test!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.68,0:14:28.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I told you, no tests!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.18,0:14:30.97,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.18,0:14:33.14,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sho-chan...?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.53,0:14:41.94,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.61,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,Huh? Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.61,0:14:44.74,Default,Boom Operator,0,0,0,,Maybe over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.16,0:14:47.45,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Did they fall for it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.45,0:14:48.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.45,0:14:49.24,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,My hand.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.12,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.12,0:14:57.42,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,You're the idol Lilly-san, right?\NWhat are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.34,0:15:02.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Even an idol's gotta cut loose\Nevery once in a while!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.76,0:15:05.38,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. It's hard work, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.39,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sorry. I know you're pretty busy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.39,0:15:10.26,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.89,0:15:13.89,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'm completely free!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.89,0:15:15.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.31,0:15:17.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's not what you said earlier...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.27,0:15:22.65,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I saw your performance when I was in Shibuya.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.65,0:15:25.99,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,And I became a huge fan!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.99,0:15:28.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You called out to me back then, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.07,0:15:31.03,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,You remembered?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.03,0:15:35.25,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,I also saw the quiz show you were on!\NIt was... pretty extreme.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.25,0:15:36.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,O-Oh, yeah. That.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.08,0:15:39.96,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.71,0:15:39.96,Alt,Boom Operator,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.08,0:15:39.96,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.84,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.38,0:15:41.84,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come back to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.92,0:15:41.84,Alt,Boom Operator,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.17,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,They're back...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.17,0:15:45.51,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,We'll run that way.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.51,0:15:46.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.13,0:15:47.38,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.33,0:15:49.57,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.06,0:15:55.64,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.89,0:15:59.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Just knock it off already!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.02,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.73,0:16:03.78,Default,Cameraman,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.78,0:16:06.20,Default,Boom Operator,0,0,0,,Run any longer...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.32,0:16:12.45,Default,TV Director,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.50,0:16:18.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I think they gave up.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.13,0:16:21.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hm? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.71,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Oh, um, nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.80,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Just hit me that it really is you, Lilly-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.80,0:16:30.59,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,It just took a while to kick in.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.59,0:16:31.97,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Shota?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.39,0:16:35.85,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Where did you run off to?\NI was looking for...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.81,0:16:37.85,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.85,0:16:40.85,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,L-Lilly-chan?! No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.85,0:16:43.48,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Hey, calm down! We're being chased!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.36,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,The coast is clear.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.36,0:16:51.03,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Haven't seen anyone like them.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.03,0:16:53.12,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Are you sure you'll be okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.12,0:16:57.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah. The agency just texted me saying\Nthey fully turned down the offer.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.46,0:17:00.71,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Wait right here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sho-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.09,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Use this.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.09,0:17:08.97,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.05,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,So you don't stand out.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.05,0:17:14.26,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, like a disguise.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.26,0:17:17.35,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Well, that's unusually considerate of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.35,0:17:18.02,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Cram it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.94,0:17:22.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.90,0:17:24.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll be on my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.73,0:17:26.98,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Oh, could you give me your autograph first?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.98,0:17:28.28,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,M-Me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.28,0:17:30.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.62,0:17:39.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You were super cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.21,0:17:42.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.34,0:17:52.34,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Lilly-chan's so cool!\NI love her even more now!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.22,0:17:54.34,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.18,0:18:03.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sho-chan and his friend's reactions\Nwere so funny!{sho-chan-tachi strikes again}
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.02,0:18:06.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,They got all blush,\Nand didn't even know it was actually me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.02,0:18:08.90,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.90,0:18:12.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Me too. I've had my fun, so let's go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.82,0:18:19.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But something still feels missing.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.33,0:18:26.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.39,0:18:42.98,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You'll find out!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.82,0:18:51.78,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I have to hurry before the sun sets!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.36,0:18:53.61,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.61,0:18:55.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Almost!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here's our stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.34,0:19:10.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.76,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Is this the place?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.76,0:19:18.89,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah. I used to come here with my sister.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.60,0:19:24.69,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We'd run around and sing together. It was so much fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.69,0:19:25.89,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.61,0:19:36.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.82,0:19:37.86,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,But summer has just ended...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.43,0:19:58.64,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,It's magic.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.81,0:20:10.11,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This is great. I missed this.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.90,0:20:16.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I made a wish to the stars
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.70,0:20:21.45,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Up in the twinkling sky
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.45,0:20:26.04,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}The clouds in the sky are so fluffy
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.50,0:20:30.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just like cotton candy
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.42,0:20:36.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I took off on the count of three
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.30,0:20:41.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}And caught the evening star
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.14,0:20:46.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're twinkling together
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.10,0:20:50.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\i1}And we'll be friends forever
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.73,0:20:56.11,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.57,0:20:58.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,A song me and big sis made together.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.95,0:20:59.91,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.07,0:21:05.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I ended up putting off school {\i1}and{\i0} idol work today!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.41,0:21:07.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wonder what I'll end up doing tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.75,0:21:10.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.92,0:21:13.34,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's ice cream.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.13,0:21:18.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh right! I wanted to eat this!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.39,0:21:27.14,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Everyone ended up going home.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.14,0:21:28.60,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Let's go home too.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.60,0:21:29.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,But let me try one more time.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:33.27,0:21:35.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.32,0:21:38.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Turn the world back to how it should be,\Nfor real this time!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.91,0:21:48.87,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,The spell ended.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.62,0:21:51.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.42,0:21:53.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.71,0:21:59.55,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Fuu, Rui, the school called.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.97,0:22:04.01,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,They said your tests will be redone tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.01,0:22:06.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aww, I knew it...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.85,0:22:07.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.52,0:22:10.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't let it end like this!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.10,0:22:14.31,Default,Ugusiu,0,0,0,,What are you planning?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.98,0:22:16.98,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.98,0:22:19.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll get rid of tests tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.48,0:22:22.99,Default,Uguisu/Azuki,0,0,0,,Please stop!
