Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.43,0:01:53.64,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bae, bae, bae
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.02,0:01:55.06,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bubee, bubee
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.06,0:01:57.73,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.73,0:02:00.44,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae, bae
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.03,0:02:03.70,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Ooh, ooh, ooh
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.70,0:02:05.74,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}You're my little buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.74,0:02:10.29,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Hey, bubee love
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.99,0:02:10.95,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.95,0:02:13.62,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}My heart is racing like crazy{ドキドキしている私}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.62,0:02:16.25,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}And right before my eyes{この目に映るのは}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.25,0:02:19.04,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Are the colors of a brand new world{新しい世界の色}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.50,0:02:20.55,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Whoa
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.59,0:02:24.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Stay with me today{今日もそばにいて}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.22,0:02:27.22,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}We'll walk hand in hand{君の手を取って行こう}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.22,0:02:31.01,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Dreaming of the place where we can become light{光に成れる場所に憧れて}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.60,0:02:37.02,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I can hear the magic{魔法の音がする}
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I wanna sing with you
